OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting is getting worse -
OL,4,Abut police won't help'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoplifting in a market town has become
OL,7,Fa "nightmare", according to some of the
OL,8,Fbusinesses based there.
OL,10,FCasey Stoddart, owner of Burns the
OL,11,FBread bakery in Glastonbury, Somerset,
OL,12,Fsaid the problem is becoming a daily
OL,13,Foccurrence, leaving him concerned about
OL,14,Fthe impact it is having on his staff.
OL,16,FHe said businesses are encouraged to
OL,17,Freport the incidents, but added police
OL,18,Foften fail to investigate, due to the
OL,19,Flow value of the items stolen.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
