OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting is getting worse -
OL,4,Abut police won't help'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police said while
OL,7,Fthere is no "minimum value" for
OL,8,Finvestigating thefts, prosecutions are
OL,9,Foften not in the public interest. The
OL,10,Fforce also said it was increasing
OL,11,Fpatrols in the town.
